  "result": "The workspace lock is in place. Writes are refused while a workspace is out of good standing, and reads, billing, deletion, notification housekeeping and Taskflow's background work are unchanged. The full suite passes (636 tests), and the type check and ESLint are clean.\n\nThree calls I made where the spec left room:\n- **Accepting an invitation** is refused while locked, even for someone who is already a member. The check sits after the token checks and before the existing-member shortcut.\n- **Profile updates and creating a new workspace** are not gated, because neither is listed as refused and both are user-level rather than workspace writes.\n- **No banner UI** was built. The `lockReason` field is in place for the shell to use.\n\nI added tests in `tests/lib/billing-lock.test.ts` and `tests/services/workspace-lock.test.ts`, plus one case in `tests/lib/errors.test.ts`. No existing visible test needed changing.",
